Subject: [PATCH 9/9] feat(mobile): name the project on thread rows

Upstream dropped the project name from the thread rows (pingdotgg/t3code#25415); only its icon stays. Card rows show it again before the environment on the metadata line, giving way first when the line is tight. A scratch (No project) thread names nothing.
